          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 3. String (str)\n",
        "String are sequences of characters used to represent text. In python string are enclosed in single quotes ('') on double quots (\"). THey behave identically, but using matching quotes allows you to include to opposite quote insid the string without escaping it ."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "mA7-cALeBSZp"
      }
    },
